{"document_id":"reg-ectoin-status-v1","title":"Ectoin — regulatory status factual card","source":"Regulatory status summary","source_family":"regulatory-status","source_url":"https://health.ec.europa.eu/scientific-committees/scientific-committee-consumer-safety-sccs/sccs-opinions_en","published_year":"","document_type":"regulatory-safety-provenance-card","evidence_tier":"regulatory-safety-provenance","chunk_text":"Paraphrased regulatory status: no dedicated CIR or EU SCCS cosmetic safety assessment for Ectoin was located; it is used in EU/US cosmetics without a dedicated panel opinion. This card records the absence of a dedicated assessment, not a safety conclusion. Re-checked 2026-09-23: still no CIR or SCCS assessment located. Peer-reviewed literature context (not a panel opinion) is linked separately in the corpus: a 2022 systematic review of topical ectoine application (Dermatology and Therapy, PMID 35038127). Paraphrased factual summary; no verbatim text is stored.","source_locator":"Absence of a dedicated CIR/SCCS cosmetic assessment for Ectoin.","citation_text":"Regulatory status summary for Ectoin in cosmetics (no dedicated CIR/SCCS opinion located).","claim_category":"ingredient-regulatory-safety-context","clinical_review_status":"pending: qualified review must establish an appropriate source before activation.","reuse_rights_status":"attribution_only","reuse_rights_basis":"Factual status paraphrase with attribution; protected expression not reproduced.","verification_status":"verified_status_no_dedicated_assessment","verified_by":"web-search-assisted draft — reviewer to source a dedicated assessment","verified_at":"2026-09-23","product_specific":false,"attribution_required":true,"routine_selection_allowed":false,"ingredient_ids":["ectoin"],"ingredient_names":["Ectoin"],"inci_names":["Ectoin"],"previous_verified_at":"2026-07-27","recheck_log":[{"date":"2026-09-23","checked":["CIR findings listing","web search for CIR/SCCS/AICIS ectoin assessments"],"outcome